# Help > Find a Command: commands by name, ranked as in the C++ palette
# (label start, word start, anywhere, then the menu path), run from the
# best enabled match; the view keys' camera angles and the interface size.
open docs/manual/examples/cu_fcc.cif
command surface slab
expect-status Ran Build > Surface Slab
command look along y
expect-camera 0 90
command lattice vector a
expect-camera 90 0
command look along z
expect-camera 0 0
rotate z 90
expect-camera 0 0 -90
rotate x 45
expect-camera 0 45
command select all
expect-selected 4
command clear selection
expect-selected 0
command ball and stick
command bonds
command structure info
command larger
expect-status Ran Settings > Interface Size: Larger (125%)
command light theme
command shortcuts
screenshot rust/target/ui/palette.png
command automatic
command dark theme
command undo
quit
